<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,493.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,493.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,493 today from 1,490 on March 18, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1501    13.625	  1500    13.614</p>
<p>   1a   1498 11344.000	  1490 11286.000</p>
